  "description": "This excellent three-bedroom terraced property comes to the rental market in superb condition throughout and boasts an enviable location in the heart of Tullamore town.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a bright and spacious kitchen/dining room, comfortable living room, three well-proportioned bedrooms and a main bathroom. The property is presented to an excellent standard and offers a practical, spacious layout ideal for modern living.\n\nIdeally positioned in Tullamore town centre, the property offers ease of access to an excellent range of local amenities, including shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, primary and secondary schools, Tullamore Train Station, bus services, Bridge Shopping Centre and Tullamore Retail Park. A variety of sporting, leisure and recreational facilities are also within easy reach.\n\nThe property further benefits from off-street parking, a particularly convenient feature for such a central location.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to rent a well-maintained three-bedroom home in a highly convenient and sought-after location, with everything Tullamore has to offer right on your doorstep.\n\nNo pets are permitted.\n\nEnquiries by email only; strictly no phone calls.\n\nAppointments for viewings will only be arranged on receipt of valid references.\n\nDue to the high volume of interest and the limited availability of rental properties in the area, it may not be possible to respond to every enquiry.\n\n\n\nViewing is highly recommended.",
